messages:
Sasha (Content): Draft uploaded for final pass — short copy, benchmark summary, and CTA wiring. Notion: https://notion.so/redwood/new-launch-draft-2024

Victor (Growth): Quick read. Hero needs a single-sentence lead and a tiny benchmark blurb. Also: split CTAs into "Start free trial" + "Request enterprise demo". Two separate funnels please.

June (Design): Fig 1 + fig 3 are good. Fig2 missing alt text (accessibility). Suggest alt: 'Median latency and throughput comparison'. Also make a small benchmark card beneath the hero so metric is visible on mobile.

Hector (Sales Ops): Routing: demo -> Sales Queue E (enterprise), trial -> auto-provision trial account. Hidden fields required on demo: arr_band, company_size, region. I'll share exact HubSpot form IDs in the shared sheet. SLA: enterprise leads should get an initial outreach within 1 business day.

Maya (Legal): Flag on copy: line reads "3x cheaper than managed alternatives" — risky. Either cite the study or soften to "observed lower per-token costs in our internal tests". Also confirm any customer quotes have written permission.

Sasha (Content): Will soften the pricing claim and add a footnote: "internal cost appendix; available to partners on request." Also moving benchmark card above the fold and shortening the hero to one punchy sentence.

publish-bot: Auto-check: meta tags present. Missing: image alt for fig2 and GA event wiring for CTA clicks. Publishing blocked until legal + sales ops confirm. :warning:

Victor (Growth): Webinar blurb under CTAs please — one line + link. Proposed: "June 17 — live demo + benchmark walkthrough. Register: https://events.redwood.ai/jun17"

June (Design): Also prepare a compact social card (1200x630 svg) and a low-contrast accessible color variant. I can attach assets after copy lock.

Hector (Sales Ops): HubSpot embed example (paste into blog):
```
// HubSpot embed for blog forms
const hubspotConfig = {
  formId: "form_trial_2024" || "form_ent_demo_2024",
