    arr_band: "${arr_band}",
    company_size: "${company_size}",
    region: "${region}",
    product_interest: "inference-platform"
  }
};
```

Hector (Sales Ops): Routing note: form_ent_demo_2024 -> Sales Queue E; configure assignment rules to route any ARR >= $250k to AE team. I'll post the mapping doc.

tracking-bot: Suggested GA + GTM snippets: send events for CTA clicks and form_submits. Example: 
```
document.querySelectorAll('.launch-cta').forEach(btn => {
  btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
    dataLayer.push({event: 'launch_cta_click', cta: btn.dataset.cta});
  });
});

document.addEventListener('submit', e => {
  if (e.target.classList.contains('launch-form')) {
    dataLayer.push({event: 'launch_form_submit', form: e.target.dataset.form});
  }
});
```

Sasha (Content): Also adding a short reproducer in the appendix (for trust): repo + command. DevRel: please paste the repo link if it's public.

Victor (Growth): Reproducer idea is great. Small snippet for appendix: 
`git clone https://github.com/redwood-inference/bench-examples && python run_bench.py --model redwood-7b --batch 8 --seq 512 --iters 5`

Maya (Legal): I'll review the softened language and the quote approvals doc. Once I sign off, legal will ok the routing metadata exposure (hidden fields).

Hector (Sales Ops): I'll validate the HubSpot IDs + assignment rules and confirm routing by EOD.

June (Design): I'll attach alt text, social svg, and mobile benchmark card once copy lock.

Sasha (Content): Target publish if no blockers: 2024-06-03 09:00 PT. Webinar: 2024-06-17 10:00 PT. If legal or sales ops has objections, please flag within 48 hours.

publish-bot: Reminder set: final checklist triggers 24h before publish. Awaiting reactions from @Maya (Legal) and @Hector (Sales Ops) to enable enterprise routing. :hourglass:

Sasha (Content): Thanks all. I'll post updated draft in ~30m with compressed hero, benchmark card up top, alt text, HubSpot embed snippet, and softened cost claim. Closing thread when done — ping me for any last-minute changes.
